          "text": "{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"There are no complete award journeys among these selected search results, so I can’t recommend a timed award itinerary yet. For the next check, start with the Alaska award lead for January 4 if Alaska is the program you want to investigate: it reports 42,500 Alaska points and 8 seats. The tradeoff is that it gives only a date—not flight times or connection details—and its USD 50.90 award-tax quote has unknown scope. The United lead is a meaningful alternative on January 2, but its points are in a different program and shouldn’t be treated as directly comparable.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A12@2027-01-04/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"Alaska award lead — January 4\",\"v\":\"SFO–BKK in economy, on AS/JX; 42,500 Alaska points and 8 reported seats. The schedule is date-only, and cabin information for individual legs is not provided. The award-tax quote is USD 50.90; its scope is unknown, so it cannot be assumed to be per person or an all-in total.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A5@2027-01-02/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"United award lead — January 2\",\"v\":\"SFO–BKK in economy, on BR/ET/SQ/UA/ZH; 55,000 United points and 9 reported seats. This is also date-only, with no individual-leg cabin information. Its award-tax quote is USD 24.50, but the scope is unknown. The points belong to United, so the number alone does not establish whether this is better value than the Alaska lead.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-01T22:55-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash-fare baseline — January 1\",\"v\":\"A separate SFO–BKK cash itinerary on Cathay Pacific, with one stop via HKG: departs January 1 at 10:55 p.m. SFO time and arrives January 4 at 10:35 a.m. Bangkok time; reported duration is 44 hours 40 minutes. The fare is USD 640.00, and its scope is unknown, so it is not a like-for-like cost comparison with the award-tax quotes.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"These are leads, not confirmed bookable itineraries or current availability. The award results provide no flight s